            "pinGroups": [
              {
                "tx": 114,
                "rx": 115
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "Only 8N1 without flow control. Receive is polled every 10 ms with a 1 KB ring buffer, so no RX interrupt is reported. UART1 is the SDK uart2 block on fixed PH2/PH3 and is opt-in: opening it stops the vendor debug console on PB3.",
        "zh-CN": "仅支持 8N1、无流控。接收由任务每 10 ms 轮询一次，1 KB 环形缓冲，因此没有 RX 中断。UART1 对应 SDK 的 uart2，固定 PH2/PH3，需要显式开启：打开后会停掉 PB3 上的厂商调试台。"
      }
    },
