      "note": {
        "en": "IIC0 is the vendor software (bit-banged) bus with fixed timing, so the requested speed is ignored and its pins come from the board config. IIC1 is the hardware bus and accepts 400 kHz only.",
        "zh-CN": "IIC0 是厂商的软件模拟（bit-bang）总线，时序固定，请求的速率不生效，引脚来自板级配置；IIC1 是硬件总线，只接受 400 kHz。"
      }
    },
