      "note": {
        "en": "Fixed 1 MHz: WL82 has no baud-rate ioctl, so any other rate is rejected. Chip select is driven by the caller as GPIO; the SPI2 USB group and the SPI0 group A route are not usable.",
        "zh-CN": "固定 1 MHz：WL82 没有波特率 ioctl，其他速率会被拒绝。片选由用户当作 GPIO 驱动；SPI2 的 USB 组和 SPI0 的 A 组不可用。"
